message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite the associated Quantum Revolt OSF registration (DOI: 10.17605/OSF.IO/U2VFK) and this repository."
title: "Quantum Revolt Reproducibility Package"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Low"
    given-names: "Pack Kwan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jaycee871/Quantum-Revolt-Reproducibility"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-03"
abstract: >-
  Public reproducibility materials for the repository-level CHSH operational
  case study used in Quantum Revolt: Nietzsche, Camus, Kuhn, and the Limits of
  Scientific Intelligibility. Includes frozen simulator and IBM Quantum
  hardware results plus guarded reproduction scripts. The associated public
  retrospective OSF registration is available at DOI 10.17605/OSF.IO/U2VFK.
keywords:
  - CHSH
  - quantum computation
  - quantum foundations
  - reproducibility
  - philosophy of physics
